# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# transient build/commit artifacts (never the source of truth)
*.staging
*.staging-*
citygov.db.bak

# run outputs (citation_todo.txt, quality_review.txt, raw logs): every writer
# creates the directory, so a fresh clone builds without it
logs/

# OS
.DS_Store

# local mirror of the source forms that ingest_new.py fills from ../Verwaltung
# (about 175 MB, not tracked); the sources the DB points to are tracked in formulare/
forms/**
!forms/README.md

# NOTE: citygov.db (the source of truth) and the generated artefacts
# (data_export.json, dashboard.html, flows.html, citygov_*.json[l], dossiers/,
# datentresor.db) ARE committed, so the worked example opens straight from the
# repo. The generated ones are only ever regenerated by ./build.sh, never
# hand-edited: dashboard.html, flows.html and dossiers/ carry a GENERATED banner,
# citygov_llm.json, citygov_ech_schemas.json, citygov_prefill.json and
# citygov_verzeichnis.json a meta block, datentresor.db a meta row, data_export.json
# a generated_at stamp; the two .jsonl files carry no marker (writer: export_llm.py).

# local DB safety snapshots (never committed)
citygov.db.backup-*
datentresor.key
.venv/

# editor / tooling residue
.Rapp.history
*.Rhistory
